From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:38:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] perf(config): parse an unchanged config.yaml once for
 read_config_doc

read_config_doc parsed config.yaml on every call, about 30 times on a gateway start (left-core recovery and the gateway loader read it once per feature). It now hands out a private copy of a parse redone only when the file's cache version changes, the rule load_yaml_file_readonly already uses.
---
 hermes_cli/config.py                  |  2 +-
 hermes_cli/config_backend.py          | 10 +++----
 scripts/check_config_yaml_readers.py  |  3 ++-
 tests/test_load_yaml_file_readonly.py | 38 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 utils.py                              | 29 +++++++++++++++-----
 5 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

